# Service account credentials. These are real Google/Firebase private keys, not
# fixtures, and `git add -A` will happily stage one that is sitting in the
# working tree. GitHub push protection blocks them, but only after they are
# already in a commit, so ignore them up front. Rotate any key that does get
# committed.
*-adminsdk.json
*service-account*.json
*serviceAccount*.json
